抱负 · aspire to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1010","en":"The gardens seem to explode with colour every spring.","zh":"每年春天，花园仿佛突然绽放出缤纷色彩。","note":"explode · 爆炸； 爆发； 激增 · explode with colour","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1011","en":"Luxuriant vegetation covers the hills after the rainy season.","zh":"雨季过后，茂密的植被覆盖着山坡。","note":"luxuriant · 繁茂的； 肥沃的； 丰富的 · luxuriant vegetation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1012","en":"The machine mixes clay and water into a thick slurry.","zh":"机器把黏土和水混成稠泥浆。","note":"slurry · 泥浆 · a thick slurry","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1013","en":"The children learned to manipulate small objects using wooden tongs.","zh":"孩子们学习用木夹子摆弄小物件。","note":"manipulate · 应付， 处理； 操纵， 控制； 影响 · manipulate an object","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1014","en":"The ecological survey recorded plant life along the riverbank.","zh":"生态调查记录了河岸沿线的植物。","note":"ecological · 生态学的， 生态的 · ecological research","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1015","en":"The new figures appear to contradict the earlier report.","zh":"新数据似乎与之前的报告相矛盾。","note":"contradict · 反驳， 驳斥； 与…发生矛盾； 相抵触 · contradict a claim","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1016","en":"Please specify your preferred date when booking the workshop.","zh":"预订工作坊时，请注明你希望参加的日期。","note":"specify · 指定； 详细说明 · specify a date","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1017","en":"The small ferry travels back and forth across the river.","zh":"这艘小渡船在河两岸之间来回行驶。","note":"forth · 离去， 外出； 向前； 向某处 · back and forth","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1018","en":"The tutor explained the relevance of the exercise to everyday design.","zh":"导师解释了这个练习与日常设计的关联。","note":"relevance · 中肯， 适当； 相关性 · practical relevance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1019","en":"A gravel path leads from the gate to the cottage.","zh":"一条砾石小路从大门通向小屋。","note":"gravel · 沙砾， 砾石 · a gravel path","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1020","en":"The wildlife film shows a leopard resting on a branch.","zh":"野生动物影片展示了一只豹卧在树枝上休息。","note":"leopard · 豹， 美洲豹 · a spotted leopard","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1021","en":"The demonstration shows how the model can submerge and rise again.","zh":"演示展示了模型如何潜入水中再浮起。","note":"submerge · 浸没； 潜入水中 · submerge in water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1022","en":"She plans to compose music for the student theatre production.","zh":"她计划为学生戏剧演出作曲。","note":"compose · 组成， 构成； 写， 创作； 使安定 · compose music","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1023","en":"The coordinator will liaise with schools to arrange the visits.","zh":"协调员将与学校联系，安排参观。","note":"liaise · 做联络人； 联络， 联系 · liaise with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1024","en":"The essay examines how strict routines can circumscribe personal freedom.","zh":"文章考察了严格的日常制度如何限制个人自由。","note":"circumscribe · 在…周围画线； 限制 · circumscribe freedom","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1025","en":"We used a roller to paint the large classroom walls.","zh":"我们用滚筒刷粉刷了教室的大面墙壁。","note":"roller · 滚筒； 滚轴 · a paint roller","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1026","en":"The early results give the restoration team grounds for optimism.","zh":"早期结果给了修复团队保持乐观的理由。","note":"optimism · 乐观， 乐观主义 · grounds for optimism","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1027","en":"The students drew a plant cell viewed through the microscope.","zh":"学生们画出了通过显微镜观察到的植物细胞。","note":"cell · 细胞； 小房间； 电池 · a plant cell","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1028","en":"The dried beans swell after soaking in water overnight.","zh":"干豆子在水中浸泡一夜后会膨胀。","note":"swell · 膨胀； 增长， 增强 · swell in size","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1029","en":"The landward side of the lighthouse faces a grassy slope.","zh":"灯塔朝陆地的一侧面向一片草坡。","note":"landward · 向陆的/地， 近陆的/地 · the landward side","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1030","en":"We built a crude model to test the basic idea.","zh":"我们搭了一个粗略的模型，检验基本设想。","note":"crude · 天然的； 粗糙的； 粗俗的 · a crude model","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1031","en":"Please remind me to return the keys before leaving.","zh":"离开前，请提醒我归还钥匙。","note":"remind · 提醒， 使想起； 使发生联想 · remind someone to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1032","en":"The manufacturer agreed to replace the faulty part immediately.","zh":"制造商同意立即更换有故障的部件。","note":"manufacturer · 制造商， 制造厂， 生产者 · a local manufacturer","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1033","en":"Her argument remains valid despite the change in circumstances.","zh":"尽管情况变了，她的论证依然成立。","note":"valid · 有效的， 具有法律效力的； 正当的； 有根据的， 有理的 · a valid argument","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1034","en":"The bridge was designed to withstand strong coastal winds.","zh":"这座桥的设计能够抵御海岸强风。","note":"withstand · 抵挡； 经受住 · withstand pressure","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1035","en":"The caretaker used a vacuum cleaner beneath the reading tables.","zh":"管理员用吸尘器清扫了阅览桌下面。","note":"vacuum · 用吸尘器清扫；真空； · a vacuum cleaner","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1036","en":"The teacher uses small groups to encourage participation.","zh":"老师采用小组活动来鼓励参与。","note":"encourage · 鼓励； 促进， 激发 · encourage participation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1037","en":"The railway marked the beginning of a new era for the town.","zh":"铁路标志着这个城镇一个新时代的开始。","note":"era · 纪元； 时代 · a new era","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1038","en":"The play raises difficult questions about morality and personal ambition.","zh":"这部剧提出了关于道德与个人抱负的难题。","note":"morality · 道德， 美德 · questions of morality","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1039","en":"The university will administer the programme through its language centre.","zh":"大学将通过语言中心管理这个项目。","note":"administer · 掌管； 给予 · administer a programme","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1040","en":"We will transplant the seedlings when the weather becomes warmer.","zh":"天气变暖时，我们会移栽这些幼苗。","note":"transplant · 移栽，移种；移植；使迁移，使移居['trænsplaːnt]；移植 · transplant seedlings","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1041","en":"The museum's zoological collection includes carefully preserved bird specimens.","zh":"博物馆的动物学藏品包括精心保存的鸟类标本。","note":"zoological · 动物学的 · a zoological collection","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1042","en":"The college is seeking accreditation for its new training programme.","zh":"学院正在为新的培训项目申请资质认证。","note":"accreditation · 证明合格， 鉴定合格 · professional accreditation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1043","en":"The tutor used a drawing to elucidate the difficult concept.","zh":"导师用图画阐明了这个难懂的概念。","note":"elucidate · 阐明， 使…清楚 · elucidate a point","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1044","en":"Lower ticket sales left the theatre with a budget deficit.","zh":"门票销量下降使剧院出现了预算赤字。","note":"deficit · 不足额， 赤字 · a budget deficit","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1045","en":"The path continues uphill until it reaches the old tower.","zh":"小路继续向上延伸，直到抵达老塔。","note":"uphill · 向上， 往上； 上坡； 艰难地 · walk uphill","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1046","en":"The aquarium guide described how a shark senses nearby movement.","zh":"水族馆导游描述了鲨鱼如何感知附近的动静。","note":"shark · 鲨鱼； 诈骗者 · a reef shark","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1047","en":"A sudden downpour sent everyone running into the station.","zh":"突如其来的暴雨让大家都跑进了车站。","note":"downpour · 暴雨 · a sudden downpour","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1048","en":"The smell of fresh coffee seemed to linger all morning.","zh":"新鲜咖啡的香气似乎整个上午都久久不散。","note":"linger · 继续逗留； 缓慢消失 · linger after","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1049","en":"She carried a heavy tome about medieval architecture to class.","zh":"她带着一本关于中世纪建筑的大部头去上课。","note":"tome · 册， 大部头书； 巨著 · a heavy tome","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:s1050","en":"The veterinary students visited a farm to observe animal care.","zh":"兽医专业的学生参观了农场，观察动物护理。","note":"veterinary · 兽医的 · veterinary students","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:w1001","en":"slacken","zh":"松弛， 放松； 放慢； 萧条","note":"英 /'slækən/ · 美 /'slækən/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1001-uk-a827e4325694.mp3","text":"slacken"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1001-us-69bbcc70a269.mp3","text":"slacken"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:w1002","en":"memorise","zh":"记住， 熟记","note":"英 /'meməraɪz/ · 美 /'meməraɪz/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1002-uk-c76a928af474.mp3","text":"memorise"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1002-us-136017cbb4be.mp3","text":"memorise"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:w1003","en":"release","zh":"释放，解放；发表，发行；释放； 发表， 发布； 排放， 泄露","note":"英 /rɪ'liːs/ · 美 /rɪ'lis/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1003-uk-010193fff036.mp3","text":"release"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1003-us-a2a1b91fb98a.mp3","text":"release"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-08:w1004","en":"charter","zh":"纲领，宣言；宪章；包租；包租； 特许设立， 给…发许可证， 给予特权","note":"英 /'t